`scripts/cluster_reset_n.sh 16` → clear dmesg → `scripts/p133_storm_errcap.sh /src/mxfs/mxfs.ko 100` (timeout 300). Expect visible≈1600, `true_silent_loss=0`, P59→0. Full proof, evidence, and the residual-debug plan are saved in memory **`sess66-zsl-bmbt-leaf-xfsaild-clobber-tenure-gate`**. Cluster is dirty from the storm runs — power-cycle before trusting any result. Other 3 criteria (fence_during_write, rsync_paired, posix_semantics_multi16) remain FAIL, untouched.

